<title>USA: Coinmach Laundry Corp Q4 shr loss vs loss.</title>
<headline>Coinmach Laundry Corp Q4 shr loss vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ROSLYN, New York 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 28,	   March 29,</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.54     loss	 $0.17</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,629     loss	 1,306</p>
<p> Revs			63,647		   44,298</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,485		    7,774</p>
<p>	  TWELVE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.14     loss	 $2.26</p>
<p> Net loss		  10,523     loss	17,564</p>
<p> Revs		     206,852		  178,789</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,233		    7,774</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net loss per share for the 1997 fourth quarter includes extraordinary loss of $0.03 per share for an extraordinary item of $10.2 million, compared with an extraordinary loss of $8.6 million, or $0.01 per share, for the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Results exclude any effect of the Reliable Laundry acquisition completed on Arpil 23, 1997, and include any effect from the January 8 acquisition of Kwik Wash Laundries the same year.</p>
